mini-batch-gradient-descent.pseudocode:
def minibatch_gd(X, y, theta, lr, batch, epochs):
    n = len(X)
    for _ in range(epochs):
        idx = shuffle(range(n))  # 에폭마다 섞기
        for s in range(0, n, batch):
            bi = idx[s:s + batch]  # 미니배치 인덱스
            g = mean_gradient(X, y, theta, bi)
            for j in range(len(theta)):
                theta[j] -= lr * g[j]  # 배치 평균으로 갱신
    return theta

